---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/"
title: false
---
<h1>Latest insights</h1>
<p>Machine-readable index: <a href="{{ site.url }}/api/posts.json">/api/posts.json</a> ·
LLM manifest: <a href="{{ site.url }}/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a> ·
Full corpus: <a href="{{ site.url }}/llms-full.txt">/llms-full.txt</a></p>
<ul>
{% for post in collections.posts %}
<li>
<a href="{{ site.url }}/posts/{{ post.data.slug or post.fileSlug }}/">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
<span data-type>[{{ post.data.type }}]</span>
<time datetime="{{ post.data.published_at }}">{{ post.data.published_at }}</time>
<br><small>{{ post.data.summary }}</small>
</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
